flowchart LR
  Source[Generated replay or consented tagged recording] --> CV[OpenCV 4 ArUco and homography]
  CV --> Temporal[Independent timed support]
  Temporal --> Engine[Authoritative recipe DAG]
  Engine --> Verdict[PASS or HOLD or abstain]
  Engine --> Evidence[(Append-only events and original frames)]
  Verdict --> UI[Procedure Studio]
  Evidence --> UI
  UI -->|Explicit authenticated request| Agent[Bounded advisory orchestrator]
  Agent --> Tools[Five scoped metadata reads]
  Tools --> Evidence
  Tools --> Packet[Typed facts and source links]
  Packet -->|Structured text only| Nebius[NVIDIA Nemotron on Nebius Token Factory]
  Nebius --> Validate[Schema, action and citation guards]
  Validate --> Advice[Generated unverified wording or refusal]
  Advice --> UI
  Verdict -.cannot be overwritten by model.-> Advice
